briefing =
    FICTIONAL SCENARIO — RESEARCH CUTOFF: 12 AUGUST 2026

    The stateless Orion Group has blocked a synthetic island strait and split its drone, surface, and ground-control network across the archipelago. No real political leader, operation, or recent attack is depicted.

    Your construction yard, refinery, barracks, and first mobile detachment are operational. Develop the complete combined-arms network: war factory, radar, repair depot, helipad, technology center, and naval yard. Use tactical designation, mechanized infantry, amphibious mobility, layered air defense, and sea-control forces to destroy all three uplinks, capture the civilian harbor relay, and neutralize the hostile surface group.

    This is a full construction mission. Harvesting, tech progression, unit choice, losses, repair, rearming, and naval placement remain under player control.

